exit: Some(0)
--- stdout ---
Register a new principal

Usage: axon-vm principal add [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Principal name (must be unique)

Options:
      --budget-tokens <BUDGET_TOKENS>
          Token budget (default: 10000) [default: 10000]
      --allowed-effects <ALLOWED_EFFECTS>
          Allowed effect rows, comma-separated (e.g. "AI,Net") [default: AI]
      --mem-mib <MEM_MIB>
          Memory limit in MiB (default: 128) [default: 128]
      --cpu-pct <CPU_PCT>
          CPU share percentage 0-100 (default: 50) [default: 50]
  -h, --help
          Print help

--- stderr ---

